  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Utility Scale Battery Energy Storage System, through K &amp; M Advisors LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to GreenCo Power Services Limited (GreenCo) funds a feasibility study to assess the technical, economic, and financial viability of developing and implementing a 10-25 megawatt (MW) / 40-100 megawatt hour (MWh) Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) pilot project (BESS Pilot Project) in Sesheke District, Zambia and a 400MWh BESS portfolio in the country. The BESS Pilot Project will be paired with a solar photovoltaic pilot project in the same region and would be one of Zambia&apos;s first utility-scale BESS projects.</narrative>
  </description>
